    "tone": "Confident, witty and minimal: a calm, self-aware voice-over that admits the product is hard to define, on a quiet monochrome canvas with a playful hand-drawn mascot, ending on a warm reframe rather than a hard sell.",
    "signature_moments": [
      {
        "shots": [
